seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# T1: a person's key on the open box: it binds the box at once and the
# close is the person's, `passed`: a key alone says nothing of what it meant.
# E8 refines T1 with the option the screen showed the key landing on (the
# `e8-*` files); this key carries none (no `key=`: typed text, no focused
# option, a screen the box no longer shows), so the close stays `passed`.
see busy
half
see prompt edit
expect open p1 approval par=t1 box=edit @500
person
see busy
expect close p1 approval out=passed by=human
